<body contenteditable=3D"false">

<div>
    <h2>DE GUZMAN</h2>

    <p>
    This book <span class=3D"span1">MS Word</span>
    <span class=3D"span1">MS Excel</span>
    <span class=3D"span1">MS PowerPoint</span> and
    <span class=3D"span1">MS Outlook</span>
    It aims to develop the core appliance of computer
    technology such as PC operation, word processing,
    spreadsheets, presentations and organization of
    schedules and contacts.
    </p>
